<title>USA: East Bridgewater, Mass., won by State Street Bank.</title>
<headline>East Bridgewater, Mass., won by State Street Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>State Street Bank and Trust Company of Boston said it won $14.405 million of East Bridgewater, Mass., various municipal purpose loan of 1996 bonds, with a true interest cost of 5.119 percent.</p>
</text>
